130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Timber is a natural product which is affected by its surrounding conditions. Proper cleaning and protection from UV rays, heat and moisture will significantly prolong the longevity of your wooden floors.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
131 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Further, It is normal for wood floors to change the gloss level over a period of time. This is not a defect and is not a ground for any claims.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
132 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Maintaining a proper temperature is essential in caring for your wooden floors. Adherence to the following parameters will ensure that your floors look as good as new, even years down the line.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
133 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText <FEFF00200053007500720066006100630065002000740065006D00700065007200610074007500720065003A002000730068006F0075006C00640020006E006F007400200065007800630065006500640020003200372103002E>
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
