140 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The above process is called oxidation and can lead to some darkening, lightening, or yellowing of the timber. In order to have an even effect, it is recommended to wait a few months before placing rugs over new floors. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
141 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Use curtains, blinds or UV-protected glass to protect flooring. Move rugs periodically to promote even ageing of the wood.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
