>>
endobj
165 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (It is essential to be cautious and prevent staining. Ensure to clean up any excess moisture from spills or splashes promptly. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
166 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Remove soaked objects such as carpets, rugs, and furniture. Ensure they are completely dry before you place them back on your floor. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
167 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Address any leaks immediately. Failing to attend to leaks can result in severe damage to your floor.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
